&lt;p&gt;📸 Scan barcodes, QR codes and others directly in the browser using &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/187338/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;STRICH&lt;/a&gt;, a lean JS SDK. &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/187338/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Free 14-day trial, try the demo app today!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
